iews only"] [329 4 "// a view of the same memory (writable through a bytearray's)"] [336 20 "// the same memory, so a writable view stays writable (PY6d's REQUEST)"] [349 2 "// count, index and toreadonly (PY7: absent): over tolist's items, as memory_count and memory_index"] [419 3 "// a 1-D view's shape, strides and contiguity (PY7: absent)"] [437 34 "// CHECK_RELEASED (PY7: obj stayed readable; no attribute \"released\", CPython's has none)"] [445 1 "// unusable is the view's CHECK_RELEASED, and its exporter's own check when it has one (queue 204: an mmap closed under"] [446 1 "// the view raises ValueError \"mmap closed or invalid\", where CPython's mmap refuses the close; pyi counts no exports)."]] :go/pos {:name [1 9] :package [1 1]} :go/semis [[40 47] [56 55] [88 17] [88 25] [106 24] [111 24] [111 33] [132 33] [140 37] [164 25] [171 25] [174 26] [198 25] [218 26] [231 14] [231 21] [277 40] [358 42] [378 42] [389 14] [389 37] [418 72] [451 68]] :go/trails [[433 5]]} (go/file "memoryview.go" :imports [

